#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:20
msgid ""
"Within your class change the ``$this->load->library('table');`` to "
"``$table = new \\CodeIgniter\\View\\Table();``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:21
msgid ""
"From that on you have to replace every line starting with "
"``$this->table`` to ``$table``. For example: ``echo "
"$this->table->generate($query);`` will become ``echo "
"$table->generate($query);``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:22
msgid ""
"The methods in the HTML Table class could be named slightly different. "
"The most important change in the naming is the switch from underscored "
"method names to camelCase. The method ``set_heading()`` from version 3 is"
" now named ``setHeading()`` and so on."
msgstr ""

